@startuml
title RPRRSBSI-V4 Rule Overlay Resolution
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F0F4FF
  BorderColor #3366CC
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF2CC
  DiamondBorderColor #B8860B
}
start
:Choose BuildSet and as-of UTC instant;
:Select active BuildSetRuleSetOccurrence rows;
:Reject duplicate Ordinal values within the BuildSet;
:Order RuleSets by BuildSetRuleSetOccurrence.Ordinal DESC;
note right
  D-2 RATIFIED:
  higher ordinal wins;
  duplicate ordinals are invalid.
end note
:Select active RuleSetRuleOccurrence rows
within each RuleSet;
:Reject duplicate occurrence ordinals within each RuleSet;
:Group occurrences by the same basic RuleId
while retaining precedence and provenance;
repeat
  :Take highest-precedence occurrence
for the next basic RuleId group;
  if (Membership role?) then (Suppress)
    :Mark RuleId suppressed;
  elseif (Override)
    :Require a lower-precedence candidate
for the same RuleId;
    :Select the Override occurrence's RuleVariant
which references that same RuleId;
  else (Add)
    :Require no lower-precedence collision
for the same RuleId;
    :Select the Add occurrence's RuleVariant;
  endif
  :Record every lower-precedence candidate
as suppressed or shadowed provenance;
repeat while (More RuleId groups?) is (yes)
->no;
:Validate calculation dependency graph;
:Emit deterministic effective rule set
and resolution provenance;
stop
note right
  D-4 RATIFIED:
  Override selects a RuleVariant of the same RuleId.
  The basic Rule is never copied for an overlay.

  V4-2: Tags/ContentSummary ingestion may create
  an Ace candidate or same-RuleId Override only.
  It never publishes an ATAP Rule directly.
end note
@enduml
